# 工具/记忆：WorkBuddy 内部（记忆/会话/日志）不入库；两个技能（源码）入库
# 用 `.workbuddy/*` 忽略内部全部内容，再逐级放出需要的技能路径（否则整树被跳过、否定不生效）
.workbuddy/*
!.workbuddy/skills/
.workbuddy/skills/*
!.workbuddy/skills/book-learning-tutor/
.workbuddy/skills/book-learning-tutor/*
!.workbuddy/skills/book-learning-tutor/SKILL.md
!.workbuddy/skills/book-learning-tutor/references/
