!.workbuddy/skills/book-learning-tutor/storage/
.workbuddy/skills/book-learning-tutor/storage/*
!.workbuddy/skills/book-learning-tutor/storage/习惯.md
# 运行时按书名生成的学习数据（含隐私/进度）不入库
.workbuddy/skills/book-learning-tutor/storage/*/
tools_dev/

# 临时
tmp/
*.bak

# 密钥（不入库）
config/backends.json

